questions.prompt:
**20 marks**

A ring-final circuit has the following symptoms:

- all sockets currently operate;
- end-to-end line continuity is open circuit;
- end-to-end neutral continuity is satisfactory;
- CPC end-to-end continuity is satisfactory;
- one socket near recent alteration work has visible conductor disturbance;
- measured `Zs` at the far point is significantly higher than expected.

a) Interpret the open-circuit line result. **(3)**
